&lt;p style="margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The differences between our actual income tax expense and the amount computed by applying the statutory federal income tax rate of 21% are summarized as follows (in millions):&lt;/font&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" style="margin-left: -0.4pt; border-collapse: collapse; height: 162px;" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

&lt;tr style="height: 27px;"&gt;
