&lt;p style="margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We do not have employees and are managed and operated by KMI, who provides services to us. Under KMI policies, we reimburse KMI at cost for direct and indirect costs incurred on our behalf and allocated general and administrative costs. These costs are reflected, as appropriate, in the "Operation, maintenance and payroll tax expenses" and "Capitalized costs" lines in the table below.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
