        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">As of December 31, 2025, we estimate that the following deferred tax balance in Account 190 could be used in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates:</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;">
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:table class="MsoTableGrid" style="width: 801.05pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;" border="1" width="1068" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
            <xhtml:tr>
              <xhtml:td style="width: 643.1pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;" valign="top" width="857">
